# 1. What exactly is LuraXDB?

luraXDB is a database platform that you will build primarily in C, starting with the fundamental mechanisms that make a database work.

Rather than using an existing database engine to execute SQL, you will implement your own core components.

The platform will have three main parts:

1. NEXUS Core: The database engine responsible for storing data, executing queries, managing transactions, and recovering from failures.
2. NEXUS Server: A C-based server that accepts network connections and processes requests from multiple clients.
3. NEXUS Studio: A graphical interface where users can write SQL, inspect tables, execute queries, and monitor the database.

We will develop these components progressively. The advanced capabilities will be added after the core database is working reliably.

