We will create these directories progressively as needed.

The README should explain the project's objectives, current features, supported platforms, build instructions, architecture, tests, benchmarks and known limitations.

Use meaningful Git commits, for example:

```text
feat: add persistent page storage
test: add storage recovery tests
fix: validate SQL parser input
perf: optimize indexed lookups
docs: document transaction guarantees
```

This makes your engineering process visible rather than presenting a single large code dump.

